    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Upon reaching 10th level, you can spend 2 fel points as a bonus action to wreathe your body in flames of fel. When you activate this aura, and at the beginning of each of your turns for its duration, you take [[/damage 1d6 fire]] damage. Immolation Aura lasts for 1 minute, until you end it as a bonus action, or until you are knocked unconscious.</p><p>Whenever a creature hits you with a melee attack for the duration of immulation aura, you deal fire damage to that creature equal to 1d6 + half your Demon Hunter level.</p>",
